  transcripts, must still exclude `tasks/*.output` and `*.meta.json`, and must not count
  any file twice.
- The unescaped-only `gitBranch` predicate: an ESCAPED `\"gitBranch\"` inside a tool
  result must never resolve as a branch fact (the fixture plants a decoy naming
  AI4DEV-999). Check the regex itself, character by character.
- The parent walk: visited-set termination on a `parentAgentId` cycle; behaviour at a
