- The kimi join: keys must be bare agent ids (the `agent-` file-name prefix stripped),
  and tree-resolved agents must feed `agentItem`.
- The unattributed percentage arithmetic and its rounding, now asserted exactly (A11).
- Override-parameter defaults: byte-identical to the old hard-coded paths. A default run
  must differ from the committed before-capture only in the header date line.

Write paths relative to the repository root.

