loop/items/AI4DEV-80/gate1-rulings.md:44: pass, and S3 (RED run) and S6 (green run) both ordered exactly that. The fix is not an
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/gate1-rulings.md:45: exception to the contract â€” it is a resequencing that also produces stronger evidence:
