loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:1: The burn report (`loop/work/attribution-report.ps1`) loses the tokens of every agent a
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:2: conductor spawns: the real agent transcripts live under `subagents/` directories the report
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:3: never scans, and the `.output` files it does scan are either empty stand-ins or full
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:4: duplicates of background agents. This change makes the report read the `subagents/`
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:5: transcripts, stop reading the `.output` files (no double-count, no background-file
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:6: inflation), build the spawn forest from the platform's `agent-*.meta.json` records, and
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:7: propagate the item down that tree for any record that resolves no item on its own â€” so a
loop/items/AI4DEV-80/pr-body.md:8: sitting's tokens land under its item and its role.
